&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;This is a set of heads based on the OOP F.W Crisis suit heads. As you can no longer get these, I figure it&amp;#39;s fair game.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Back when I started playing, I absolutely loved the sleek lines and curves of the FW Pattern crisis suits, but they were always out of my budget.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;So I figured I should make a set of heads and share &amp;#39;em out because I imagine other people had that desire.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;I&amp;#39;m not 100% sure these are scaled, but they should be. I don&amp;#39;t have a crisis suit on hand to check however so YMMV.
